title: Include declared morning automation in daily release blocker alerts and successful recovery
description: "Actual morning_dispatcher run38106151668 failed when signed npm2026.10.11 metadata remained unavailable, but Alert on blocked scheduled auto-release was skipped because its condition includes schedule and issues only. Successful blocker resolution is likewise schedule-only. Complete all-status census2922 plus live morning search and full pm-prrlce/pm-wzmbvn history found the broader origin parent but no concrete active alert owner. Preserve completed propagation-budget work and all source-origin verification."
