acceptance_criteria: Native schedule and declared morning dispatcher failures open or update the canonical daily blocker; their successful exact-tag recovery closes it; operator dispatch is excluded; stale blocker supersession and trigger-origin diagnostics are preserved; source conditions and native Bash negative controls prove the event matrix.
