actual_result: "19linked workflow tests pass; independent original source and Bash controls reproduce the omission, corrected event matrix and stale supersession pass, source/types/docs/integrity/mutation and9packed npm/Bun consumers are verified. Actual accepted-but-unavailable daily publication remains independently tracked under release health."
